UPDATE companies SET description='Keystone Solutions Group operates from Kalamazoo, Michigan, where it has provided medical device contract manufacturing services for more than 25 years. The company is led by President Jim Medsker and a leadership team that includes VP of Sales and Business Development Jason Barr, VP of Engineering Vaughn Gerber, and Director of Quality & Regulatory William Reinholt.

The firm specializes in assembly, kitting, packaging, converting, and sterilization management, supporting programs from prototype and pilot builds through full-scale production. Its capabilities include multiple clean room environments, supply chain sourcing, warehousing, and distribution. The team of engineers, program leads, and production specialists manages end-to-end manufacturing of single-use disposable and reusable medical products.

Keystone serves the medical device industry worldwide, working with customers ranging from start-ups to established OEMs. Its Customer Product Transfer Process handles project planning through commercial release, addressing regulatory, intellectual property, and commercial challenges that arise during product launch.

The company emphasizes a collaborative approach that goes beyond typical OEM/contract manufacturer relationships, offering complete end-to-end solutions from concept through approval and production. Its differentiators include in-house sterilization validation expertise, clean room qualification, and a quality system aligned with ISO 13485 and FDA QSR requirements.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485','FDA QSR','GMP']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Assembly", "Kitting", "Packaging", "Converting", "Sterilization management", "Clean room operations", "Warehousing", "Distribution", "Supply chain sourcing", "Product transfer management", "Prototyping and pilot builds", "Full-scale production", "Quality system management (ISO 13485, FDA QSR)", "Sterilization validation", "Clean room qualification"], "industries": ["Medical Device Contract Manufacturing", "Medical Device Industry (single-use disposable and reusable medical products)"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototypes and pilot builds to full-scale production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Customer Product Transfer Process managing project planning to commercial release", "Multiple clean room environments with in-house sterilization validation", "End-to-end solutions from concept through approval and production", "Collaborative approach addressing regulatory, IP, and commercial challenges", "Supply chain sourcing, warehousing, and distribution integrated with manufacturing"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Kalamazoo, Michigan -> db", "Medical device contract manufacturer -> /about", "In operation more than 25 years -> /about", "President Jim Medsker, leadership team listed -> /about", "Services: assembly, kitting, packaging, converting, sterilization management, clean rooms, warehousing, distribution -> /", "Prototype to full-scale production -> /", "Customer Product Transfer Process -> /", "Serves medical device industry worldwide, start-ups to OEMs -> /about, /", "Collaborative approach, end-to-end solutions, regulatory/IP/commercial challenges -> /about", "ISO 13485, FDA QSR, GMP mentioned in quality context -> /quality", "Clean room qualification, sterilization validation (EO) -> /quality"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Keystone specializes in assembly, kitting, packaging, converting and sterilization management from prototypes and pilot builds to full-scale production.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='keystone-solutions-group' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Ames, Iowa, Kiliper Corporation has been delivering packaging solutions for more than 25 years. The company operates as a family-owned business and is part of the Inovar Packaging Group, a national packaging partner that provides expanded resources and a broader manufacturing network.

Kiliper specializes in stretch sleeve labeling, roll-fed label production, and flexible packaging, supported by advanced flexographic printing capabilities. The company offers material expertise and helps customers navigate packaging decisions, optimize materials, and deliver solutions aligned with brand and operational needs. Production is characterized by quick turnaround times and adaptable capabilities that support a wide range of program scales.

The company serves industries including food and beverage, household products, industrial, pet care, and agriculture. Its customers are brands seeking efficient, cost-effective packaging solutions that perform across applications such as full-container decoration and high-speed labeling.

Kiliper emphasizes a hands-on, service-driven approach built on long-term relationships, deep knowledge of stretch sleeve and roll-fed label applications, and reliable processes that ensure consistent quality. The partnership with Inovar adds scalable support while maintaining the responsiveness and personalized service the company is known for.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Stretch sleeve labeling", "Roll-fed label production", "Flexible packaging", "Flexographic printing", "Material selection and optimization", "Packaging design support"], "industries": ["Food & beverage", "Household products", "Industrial", "Pet care", "Agriculture"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Quick turnaround times and adaptable production capabilities", "Hands-on, service-driven team focused on long-term relationships", "Deep knowledge of stretch sleeve and roll-fed label applications", "Reliable processes ensuring consistent quality", "Backed by Inovar''s nationwide network for expanded resources and production flexibility"], "facts_used": ["Location: Ames, Iowa -> db", "Operating for more than 25 years -> /about-us", "Family-owned foundation -> /about-us", "Part of Inovar Packaging Group -> /about-us", "Specializes in stretch sleeve and roll-fed label technologies -> /about-us", "Flexographic printing capabilities -> /about-us", "Material expertise and packaging decision support -> /about-us", "Quick turnaround times and adaptable production -> /about-us", "Industries served: food & beverage, household products, industrial, pet care, agriculture -> /about-us", "Customer-first approach and long-term relationships -> /about-us", "Consistent quality and reliable processes -> /about-us", "Scalable support through Inovar''s nationwide network -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Kiliper Corp, an Inovar company, has delivered high-quality packaging solutions with a focus on stretch sleeves, flexible packaging, and roll-fed label technologies.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='kiliper-corporation' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Killian''s Custom Metal Roofing & Panel LLC is based in Des Moines, Iowa. The company opened in the fall of 2013, though founder Paula Killian had envisioned the business since the late 1990s. After working at a steel company in Tulsa, Oklahoma, she gained hands-on experience at B&M Metals in Murrayville, Georgia, learning panel fabrication and trim production before launching her own operation.

The shop manufactures custom-cut 3-foot-wide metal panels and matching trim pieces. Its product line includes Tuff Rib panels—29-gauge steel with Sherwin Williams WeatherX paint carrying a 40-year warranty, available in 22 colors or Galvalume—for residential roofs, pole barns, and post-frame agricultural buildings. The company also fabricates standing-seam panels and distributes commercial architectural profiles such as R-Panel, PBR, corrugated rusted panels, and architectural wall and roof systems. In-house capabilities cover fabrication, installation, and distribution, with a typical order turnaround of two to three days.

Killian''s serves residential, agricultural, and commercial construction markets. Homeowners and contractors purchase Tuff Rib for houses and pole barns, while commercial projects source architectural panel systems for wall and roof applications. The company also assists customers with repair or replacement matching for existing installations.

Paula Killian started the business to provide the highest level of customer service she had seen emphasized during her training, aiming to sell high-quality materials at the lowest possible price. The firm highlights its 25-plus years of combined industry experience, a staff with deep metal-construction knowledge, and a commitment to timely quotes and responses as its core differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal panel fabrication (3'' wide)", "Metal roof installation", "Panel distribution (R-Panel, PBR, corrugated, architectural)", "Custom trim fabrication", "Standing seam panel fabrication", "Tuff Rib panel manufacturing (29 gauge steel, WeatherX paint)", "Architectural wall and roof system supply"], "industries": ["Residential roofing", "Agricultural buildings (pole barns, post-frame)", "Commercial architectural", "Metal construction"], "materials": ["29 gauge steel", "Sherwin Williams WeatherX paint", "Galvalume"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "2-3 days for typical orders", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom-cut 3'' wide panels and trims", "25+ years of metal construction experience", "2-3 day typical order completion", "High-quality materials at lowest price", "Staff with years of metal construction experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded Fall 2013 -> /about-us", "Founder Paula Killian, Owner/General Manager -> /about-us", "Located at 630 S.E. 15th Street, Des Moines, IA 50317 -> /", "Manufactures custom cut 3'' wide panels and trims -> /", "25+ years of experience in metal construction -> /", "Tuff Rib panels: 29 gauge steel, WeatherX paint, 40-year warranty -> /", "Standing seam fabrication and installation, 17 years experience -> /", "Distributes commercial architectural panels (R-Panel, PBR, corrugated, architectural) -> /", "Typical order completion in 2-3 days -> /about-us", "Goal: high-quality materials at lowest price, excellent customer service -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Killian''s Custom Metal Panel and Roofing LLC manufactures custom cut 3'' wide panels and trims.", "founded_year": "2013", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='killian-s-custom-metal-roofing-panel-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='King Lumber Company operates from Forest, Mississippi, with an additional production facility in Jasper, Texas. The company has been supplying wood products for over 50 years, though a precise founding year is not publicly disclosed. Ownership details and founder names are not provided in available sources.

The company produces Southern Yellow Pine lumber, including 1-inch boards in various grades (D and Better, #2, #3 GM, #3/#4 HT) and 5/4-inch decking in premium and standard grades. Combined output from its two facilities exceeds 45 million board feet annually. King Lumber also manages logistics through both internal and external trucking fleets to expedite delivery.

