 /quality", "Quick turnaround on time-sensitive projects -> /quality", "Adaptable packaging and fill requirements -> /quality", "On-site labs and built-in quality controls -> /quality", "Traceability program, mock recalls, facility security, third-party audits -> /quality", "Scalable turnkey solutions for liquid/dry food products -> /capabilities"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We provide scalable turnkey solutions for companies who want to produce and package a liquid or dry food product on a large scale.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='kingmaker-foods' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Kitchen Local, LLC operates a certified shared-use commercial kitchen in Amesbury, Massachusetts. Founded in 2013, the facility occupies 2,200 square feet within Studios, a historic brick building that once housed Chas. J. Henschel & Co., a carriage and automotive manufacturer. The building sits a few blocks from downtown Amesbury at the intersection of the North Shore and Merrimack Valley regions, just over the New Hampshire border. The company is a member of the Amesbury Chamber of Commerce & Industry.

The kitchen provides around-the-clock access to permitted commercial kitchen work and storage space for food entrepreneurs. It serves chefs, bakers, small-scale food producers, farmers, and cooking and nutrition instructors who use the facility for food production, catering, baking, cooking classes, menu planning, training, recipe testing, photography, and product development. Kitchen Local guides participant businesses through permitting and licensing, connects them with resources, assists with business concept and strategic planning, and helps promote their businesses.

The facility serves culinary professionals and food startups across the North Shore and Merrimack Valley areas. Its participant businesses include food producers, caterers, bakers, and instructors who need affordable, permitted kitchen space without large capital investment. The collaborative environment fosters a community of food entrepreneurs.

Kitchen Local was established to fill a niche for culinary professionals by minimizing risk and start-up costs, allowing food businesses to launch or expand immediately without significant initial capital investment.', certifications=ARRAY['Certified shared-use kitchen','Amesbury Board of Health food service permit']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Commercial kitchen rental", "Food production space", "Catering kitchen access", "Baking facilities", "Cooking class space", "Recipe testing", "Product development kitchen", "Food photography space", "Permitting and licensing guidance", "Business consulting for food startups", "Dry and cold storage", "Shared-use kitchen membership"], "industries": ["Food production", "Catering", "Baking", "Culinary education", "Food entrepreneurship", "Small-scale food manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Compartment sink"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Around-the-clock access to permitted commercial kitchen and storage", "Guidance through permitting and licensing with Amesbury Board of Health", "Business concept and strategic planning assistance for participants", "Promotion support for participant businesses"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2013 -> db", "Located at 14 Cedar Street Studios, Amesbury, MA -> db and /", "2,200 square foot facility -> /", "Formerly Chas. J. Henschel & Co. building -> /", "Member of Amesbury Chamber of Commerce & Industry -> db", "Certified shared-use kitchen -> /", "Around-the-clock access to kitchen and storage -> /", "Serves chefs, bakers, food producers, farmers, instructors -> /", "Uses: food production, catering, baking, classes, recipe testing, photography, product development -> /", "Provides permitting/licensing guidance, business consulting, promotion help -> /", "Offers 90-minute confidential consultation -> /", "Compartment sink mentioned -> products list", "Food Service Permit Application to Amesbury Board of Health -> capabilities list"], "company_t