UPDATE companies SET description='LA Packaging, based in Yorba Linda, California, was founded in 1984 by Edward Loritz Sr. with a commitment to supplying American-made hinged-lid plastic containers at affordable prices. The company continues his legacy, manufacturing its product lines domestically using medical-grade, Class VI polypropylene that meets REACH, RoHS, and FDA requirements.

Its production capabilities have expanded to serve customers across North America, Europe, and Asia, with all manufacturing performed in the United States.

LA Packaging serves the electronic, medical, pharmaceutical, industrial, food, and laboratory sectors. It also operates two direct-to-customer e-commerce sites: lacontainerstore.com for bulk orders and esdplasticcontainers.com for small-quantity, no-minimum purchases of ESD-inhibiting containers.

