UPDATE companies SET description='LIW Furniture operates from East Earl in Lancaster County, Pennsylvania. The family-owned business is led by Case Taylor, who brought hands-on experience from Amish Artisan Woodcraft into the venture. Taylor''s background in cabinetry, millwork, and custom furniture shaped the company''s focus on practical design and durable construction.

The shop produces custom hardwood and iron furniture — dining tables, chairs, cabinets, office pieces, and specialty items — all hand crafted on site. Materials are sourced from native Appalachian forests, giving the team control over lumber selection through local partnerships. Customers choose from a catalogue of solid-wood designs or collaborate with in-house designers and craftsmen to specify finishes, hardware, and live-edge tops with custom bases.

LIW serves both residential and commercial clients. Restaurants, retail spaces, and offices have commissioned dining sets, built-ins, vanities, and bar installations; a restaurant project for John Harris is cited as a reference. The company also works with homeowners on dining-room collections and one-off pieces.

The company emphasizes that it never sacrifices quality for quantity, maintaining oversight from raw lumber to final finish. Its differentiators include locally sourced hardwoods, hand-crafted construction in a Lancaster wood shop, and a design process that lets customers tailor stains, paints, metal features, and live-edge details to exact specifications.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture manufacturing", "Cabinetry", "Millwork", "Woodworking", "Metal/iron fabrication", "Finishing (stains, paints, stain combinations)", "Custom design consultation", "Live edge table construction", "Commercial grade furniture production", "Custom base fabrication", "Hardware selection and installation"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Commercial furniture", "Hospitality", "Retail", "Office furniture"], "materials": ["Appalachian hardwoods", "Native Pennsylvania hardwoods", "Iron/steel", "Stains", "Paints", "Finishes"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Locally sourced hardwoods from Appalachian forests", "Hand crafted in Lancaster, PA wood shop", "Custom design with experienced craftsmen", "Live edge tables and custom base options", "Quality guaranteed with no corners cut"], "facts_used": ["Family-owned custom furniture company in Lancaster County, PA -> db", "Owner Case Taylor with background in Amish Artisan Woodcraft -> /about", "Hand crafted in Lancaster, PA wood shop -> /", "Locally sourced hardwoods from Appalachian forests -> /", "Custom hardwood and iron furniture: tables, chairs, cabinets, office furniture -> /about", "Live edge tables and custom base options -> /", "Serves residential and commercial clients (restaurants, retail, offices) -> /about", "Restaurant project for John Harris -> /about", "Team of designers, project managers, craftsmen -> /about", "Quality guarantee, no sacrifice of quality for quantity -> /", "Endless customization options for finishes, hardware, met