UPDATE companies SET description='Larry''s Auto Parts opened its first location in Honolulu, Hawaii, on March 1, 1965, after founder Larry Isono was honorably discharged from the U.S. Army and gained experience at local auto parts stores. Together with his wife Fumie, who managed accounting and delivery, they converted a former doctor''s office in Moili`ili into a parts shop.

