UPDATE companies SET description='Lattice Materials was founded in 1989 in Bozeman, Montana, and has grown into a globally recognized U.S. manufacturer of silicon and germanium components. The company operates as part of The Partner Companies (TPC), a consortium of specialty manufacturers that share resources across defense, aerospace, medical, and other high-technology sectors.

The 30,000-square-foot facility houses custom crystal growth furnaces, CNC and basic machining centers, curve generation equipment, polishing stations, and in-house metrology. The company also applies custom thin-film coatings such as anti-reflective (AR) and diamond-like carbon (DLC). These capabilities allow Lattice Materials to produce precision optics, mirrors, and semiconductor parts with full material traceability.

Customers span defense, aerospace, medical, telecommunications, semiconductor, and renewable energy industries. The company focuses on mission-critical applications where parts must perform reliably in extreme environments — on the ground, in the sky, or above the atmosphere.

Lattice Materials emphasizes an unwavering commitment to quality and precision, backed by ISO 9001 certification and ITAR registration. Its stated mission is to be the high-precision manufacturer of complete optical solutions for mission-critical applications, offering competitive pricing, rapid delivery, and service.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom Crystal Growth", "Basic Machining", "CNC Machining", "Curve Generation", "Polishing", "Metrology", "Thin Film Coatings (AR, DLC)", "Precision Optics Manufacturing", "Mirror Manufacturing", "Semiconductor Parts Manufacturing"], "industries": ["Defense", "Aerospace", "Medical", "Telecommunications", "Semiconductor", "Renewable Energy"], "materials": ["Silicon", "Germanium"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom crystal growth of silicon and germanium", "30,000 sq ft manufacturing facility with in-house metrology", "ITAR registered and ISO 9001 certified", "Full material traceability on all parts", "Thin film coatings including AR and DLC"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1989 in Bozeman, Montana -> /about", "30,000 sq ft manufacturing facility -> /about", "Custom crystal growth, machining, polishing, metrology, thin film coatings -> /capabilities", "Industries: defense, aerospace, medical, telecommunications, semiconductor, renewable energy -> /about", "ISO 9001 and ITAR certified -> /about", "Part of The Partner Companies group -> /about", "Leadership team names (Travis Wood, Alonso Bustamante, Mike Stoddard, etc.) -> /about", "Mission statement: leading high-precision manufacturer of complete optical solutions -> /about", "Silicon and germanium materials with full traceability -> /", "Precision optics, mirrors, semiconductor parts -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "US-based manufacturer of silicon and germanium parts", "founded_year": "1989", "employee_count": "", "cage_code"