UPDATE companies SET description='Legend Electronics was founded in 1991 in Hawthorne, New York, as an independent stocking distributor of electronic components. The company began with a focus on hard-to-find and obsolete parts, building a global sourcing network to serve customers facing allocation, long lead times, and discontinued devices.

