UPDATE companies SET description='Lighting Virginia operates as a statewide lighting agency headquartered in Roanoke, Virginia. The firm represents a curated roster of lighting manufacturers and serves specifiers and contractors across the commonwealth. While its founding year is not publicly disclosed, the agency notes that its team brings a combined experience of more than three centuries to each project.

